{"3622570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sorter (Early Access)", "steam_appid": 3622570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [3673270], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Sorter</strong>, you’re dropped into a mysterious facility with one simple directive: organize the chaos. Build stairways, bridges, and towers to navigate an ever-evolving environment. Master the laws of falling-object physics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But under the surface of this serene sorting simulator lies something...strange. Clues hide in plain sight. Patterns whisper. As you unlock new abilities and advance through each handcrafted level, a deeper question begins to take shape: Why are you here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill first-person puzzle gameplay</strong> focused on logic, color (Colorblind option), and spatial thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build with purpose -</strong> Use cubes to create paths, solve challenges, or just make something oddly satisfying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new abilities </strong>that reshape how you interact with the world and the cubes in it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover a hidden narrative -</strong> Told with puzzles, implication and hidden clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meditative vibes</strong> with no timers, no enemies, just you, cubes, and a lot of puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Sorter</strong>, you’re dropped into a mysterious facility with one simple directive: organize the chaos. Build stairways, bridges, and towers to navigate an ever-evolving environment. Master the laws of falling-object physics. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But under the surface of this serene sorting simulator lies something...strange. Clues hide in plain sight. Patterns whisper. As you unlock new abilities and advance through each handcrafted level, a deeper question begins to take shape: Why are you here?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Chill first-person puzzle gameplay</strong> focused on logic, color (Colorblind option), and spatial thinking.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build with purpose -</strong> Use cubes to create paths, solve challenges, or just make something oddly satisfying.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock new abilities </strong>that reshape how you interact with the world and the cubes in it.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover a hidden narrative -</strong> Told with puzzles, implication and hidden clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meditative vibes</strong> with no timers, no enemies, just you, cubes, and a lot of puzzles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Enter a serene world of falling cubes, mysterious chutes and bright colors. Build solutions, solve puzzles, and unlock new abilities in this chill first-person game where even the simplest task might hold a deeper purpose.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622570/0bb5ef81bc1670ee644b5eef424ee53d67fbe520/header.jpg?t=1775494898", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622570/6188f96a3c6a1d07b3eecebf42d7aad1dd0b95f9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1775494898", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3622570/6188f96a3c6a1d07b3eecebf42d7aad1dd0b95f9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1775494898", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and